§ `O. Articles 12 to 15`

`two enactments` MEANS `Offences arising from one act or omission` WITH
    `the enactments that create the offences` IS LIST "the Alpha Law", "the Beta Law"
    `it is also an offence under the customary law of Jersey` IS FALSE
`one enactment and the customary law` MEANS `Offences arising from one act or omission` WITH
    `the enactments that create the offences` IS LIST "the Alpha Law"
    `it is also an offence under the customary law of Jersey` IS TRUE
`two offences in one enactment` MEANS `Offences arising from one act or omission` WITH
    `the enactments that create the offences` IS LIST "the Alpha Law", "the Alpha Law"
    `it is also an offence under the customary law of Jersey` IS FALSE
`one offence only` MEANS `Offences arising from one act or omission` WITH
    `the enactments that create the offences` IS LIST "the Alpha Law"
    `it is also an offence under the customary law of Jersey` IS FALSE

-- O01-O02  V1 src:60: an act that is an offence under two enactments: prosecuted and punished under either
#ASSERT `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `two enactments` "the Alpha Law" FALSE
#ASSERT `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `two enactments` "the Beta Law" FALSE
-- O03  V1 src:60: an offence under an enactment and under the customary law of Jersey: either
#ASSERT `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `one enactment and the customary law` "the customary law of Jersey" FALSE
-- O06  V1 src:60 says "2 or more enactments": two offences in the same enactment are not dealt with
#ASSERT REFUSED `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `two offences in one enactment` "the Alpha Law" FALSE
-- O08  an act that is an offence under one enactment only: Article 12 is not engaged
#ASSERT REFUSED `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `one offence only` "the Alpha Law" FALSE
-- O07  V1 src:60 "unless the contrary intention appears"
#ASSERT REFUSED `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `two enactments` "the Alpha Law" TRUE
-- O09t  a route that is not one of the offences (added in the test file; not the O09 of decisions.md)
#ASSERT REFUSED `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `two enactments` "the Gamma Law" FALSE
-- O04  V1 src:60 "shall not be liable to be punished twice for the same offence"
#ASSERT `is the offender liable to be punished again for the same offence` (YMD 2020 6 1) `two enactments` TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- O05  not yet punished: liable to be punished
#ASSERT `is the offender liable to be punished again for the same offence` (YMD 2020 6 1) `two enactments` FALSE FALSE
-- O04b  contrary intention
#ASSERT REFUSED `is the offender liable to be punished again for the same offence` (YMD 2020 6 1) `two enactments` TRUE TRUE
-- O10  V2f src:66, and before 2019
#ASSERT `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2026 10 1) `two enactments` "the Beta Law" FALSE
#ASSERT `is the offender liable to be punished again for the same offence` (YMD 2026 10 1) `two enactments` TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT REFUSED `may the offender be prosecuted and punished under this enactment` (YMD 2018 12 31) `two enactments` "the Alpha Law" FALSE

-- O11-O13  V1 src:62: a fine of 5,000 specified: punishable by a fine not exceeding it (5,000 yes; 5,001 no; 4,999 yes)
#ASSERT `is the offence punishable by the penalty proposed` (YMD 2020 6 1) TRUE 5000 5000 FALSE
#ASSERT `is the offence punishable by the penalty proposed` (YMD 2020 6 1) TRUE 5000 5001 FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `is the offence punishable by the penalty proposed` (YMD 2020 6 1) TRUE 5000 4999 FALSE
-- O14  imprisonment of 24 months specified: 24 yes, 25 no, 18 yes
