GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
      how IS A `Way a distance was measured`
GIVETH A `Distance as measured`
`distance of` n how MEANS
    `Distance as measured` WITH
        `the distance` IS n
        `the unit` IS "metres"
        `the way it was measured` IS how

